# NOT INSTALLED — kept only as a reference.
#
# Tried 2026-09-16 11:31 UTC as MUST-11 "disk activity LED" polish, reverted
# 2026-09-16 ~12:2x UTC at owner request.
#
# The DS115j bay LED is bi-color. Only the AMBER half is a Linux gpio-led
# (synology:amber:disk, MPP31). The GREEN half is driven by the SATA link in
# hardware and is not visible in /sys/class/leds. Driving amber from
# disk-activity therefore makes the bay LED blink ORANGE on every I/O and
# masks the normal GREEN. Owner wants the bay LED GREEN.
#
# Amber should stay off (trigger=none, brightness=0) and be reserved for a
# real fault indication.
#
# ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="leds", KERNEL=="synology:amber:disk", ATTR{trigger}="disk-activity"
